# Força o git a tratar arquivos-fonte como TEXTO em diff/blame/merge.
#
# Por quê: neste ambiente (Windows + OneDrive) a auto-detecção de binário do git
# marcava arquivos .ts/.tsx como "Binary files differ" mesmo sendo UTF-8 puro
# (sem BOM, sem byte NUL) — quebrando `git diff`, `git log -p`, blame e review.
#
# Usamos o atributo `diff` (NÃO `text`) de propósito: força diff textual SEM
# normalizar EOL (evita um churn em massa de CRLF→LF no working tree atual).
*.ts    diff
*.tsx   diff
*.js    diff
*.jsx   diff
*.mjs   diff
*.cjs   diff
*.json  diff
*.md    diff
*.mdx   diff
*.css   diff
*.scss  diff
*.html  diff
*.yml   diff
*.yaml  diff
*.prisma diff
*.sh    diff
*.env   diff
